'  rival.script from the cut, in a new process: nothing on the command line
' about the opponent, the scenario or the outcome - all three come out of the
' save.
load
mapclick 150,318         ' walk in, where their man holds the place
wait 120
fight                    ' speak or fight, and this is a fight
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
clickon 38
save                     ' and what fourteen blows with a knife come to
